											width:100%;
											max-width:100%;
											height:auto;
											border:0;" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" /></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Hello <strong>Arelia Manager</strong>,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">This is to inform you that the client has <strong>formally approved the 3D Design Proposal</strong> for the project below.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">The design has now been submitted for your <strong>final managerial approval</strong> before proceeding to the next phase.</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;
											  margin-bottom:18px;" width="100%">
