          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Please review the client-approved 3D design and provide your final managerial decision using the button below.</p>
