														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><a href="[APPROVAL_LINK]" style="color:#9A6D1F;
															  text-decoration:none;
															  font-weight:bold;">Open Approval Page › </a></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Kindly review the approved 3D design and provide your final approval so that further execution and planning activities can proceed.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">If any additional clarification or changes are required at this stage, please provide the necessary remarks while reviewing the design.</p> <p style="margin:0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Warm regards,<br /> <strong>Team Arelia</strong></p></td>
